OL,3,AStorm Austen brings 84mph wind gusts as
OL,4,Athousands of UK homes without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen is causing widespread
OL,7,Fpower cuts and travel disruption ` with
OL,8,Fwind gusts of 84mph (135km/h) recorded
OL,9,Fat Jersey Airport
OL,11,FMore than 18,000 homes in parts of
OL,12,FEngland and Wales are without power as
OL,13,Fmillions remain under a yellow weather
OL,14,Fwarning for wind
OL,16,FIn Brighton, a section of the iconic
OL,17,FWest Pier has collapsed into the sea
OL,18,Fafter large waves battered it
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
